    - :func:`jax.numpy.nancumprod`: cumulative product ignoring NaN values.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.prod`: product along axis

  Examples:
    >>> x = jnp.array([[1, 2, 3],
    ...                [4, 5, 6]])
